        "answer": {
          "short": "$x = 12.8\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}PX &= 24-8\\\\PX &= 16\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe products of the intercepts of intersecting chords are equal.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}KX\\times XL &= PX\\times XQ\\\\10x &= 16\\times8\\\\10x &= 128\\\\x &= 12.8\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
